  translation {
    text: "Affected northbound trips:\r\n9:07 am from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n9:48 am from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n10:33 am from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n11:18 am from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n12:03 pm from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n1:33 pm from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n2:18 pm from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n3:03 pm from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n3:48 pm from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n4:33 pm from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n5:18 pm from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n\nAffected southbound trips:\r\n9:29 am from 30th & Downing Station to 16th & Stout Station\r\n10:14 am from 30th & Downing Station to 16th & Stout Station\r\n10:59 am from 30th & Downing Station to 16th & Stout Station\r\n11:44 am from 30th & Downing Station to 16th & Stout Station\r\n12:29 pm from 30th & Downing Station to 16th & Stout Station\r\n1:14 pm from 30th & Downing Station to 16th & Stout Station\r\n1:59 pm from 30th & Downing Station to 16th & Stout Station\r\n2:44 pm from 30th & Downing Station to 16th & Stout Station\r\n3:29 pm from 30th & Downing Station to 16th & Stout Station\r\n4:14 pm from 30th & Downing Station to 16th & Stout Station\r\n4:59 pm from 30th & Downing Station to 16th & Stout Station"
